# Arlecchino Citlali Rosaria Bennett. ~17s Rot. Arlecchino Double Cryo Melt with N1C 5N3D N1; Arlecchino can own more Melts with no N1 start. Citlali after Rosaria for TTDS. No Arlechinno CA cancel needed. Ins Rosaria is worse.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
arle char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
